    "chunk_text": "\u00e6nne d\u00e6g fram sunnan upgange o\u00f0 \u00e6fen, ac swa \u00f0eah on bocum is geteald to anum d\u00e6ge Seo sunne is swi\u00f0e micel, eal swa brad heo is \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e bec secga\u00f0, swa eal eor\u00f0an ymbhwyrft, ac heo \u00c6lc \u00f0ing swa hit \u00f0e fyrr bi\u00f0, swa hit \u00f0e l\u00e6sse \u00f0inc\u00f0. We magon hw\u00e6\u00f0ere tocnawan be hire leoman, \u00fe\u00e6t heo unlytel is. Swa hra\u00f0e swa heo upastih\u00f0 heo scin\u00f0 geond ealle eor\u00f0an gelice, & ealre eor\u00f0an bradnysse endemes Eac swilce \u00f0a steorran \u00f0e us lytle \u00f0inca\u00f0, sind swi\u00f0e brade, ac for \u00f0am micclum f\u00e6ce \u00fee us Hi ne mihton swa \u00f0eah nan leoht to eor\u00f0an asendan, fram \u00f0\u00e6re healican heofenan, gif hi swa So\u00f0lice se mona & ealle steorran underfo\u00f0 leoht of \u00f0\u00e6re micclan sunnan, & heora nan n\u00e6f\u00f0 n\u00e6nne & \u00f0eah \u00f0e seo sunne under eor\u00f0an on nihtlicere tide scine, \u00feeah astih\u00f0 hire leoht on sumere sidan Seo sunne getacna\u00f0 urne h\u00e6lend Crist, se \u00f0e is rihtwisnysse sunne, swa swa se witega cw\u00e6\u00f0. Timentibus autem nomen domini, orietur sol iustiti\u00e6, et sanitas in pennis eius; \u00feam mannum \u00fee him Se mona \u00f0e weax\u00f0 & wana\u00f0 getacna\u00f0 \u00feas andwerdan gela\u00f0unge, \u00f0e we on sind. Seo is weaxende \u00feurh acennedum cildum, & wanigende \u00feurh for\u00f0farendum. \u00d0a beorht",
